---
description: Git branching model — develop integration, main releases
alwaysApply: true
---

docforge-branching:

- Integration branch is `develop`. Open feature/fix PRs against `develop`, not `main`.
- `main` is the release branch. Promote to `main` only via a controlled PR from `develop` (or a release branch cut from `develop`).
- GitHub Actions image publish runs only on `main` (and version tags / workflow_dispatch) — not on `develop` and not on PRs.
- Do not push feature work directly to `main`.
- Prefer conventional commits and small focused PRs into `develop`.
